# The organisation of the E0 core "ascending" of Genesis's Origin chemistry: formaldehyde's network, rebuilt
# from data/origin/e0/cores/ascending.core.tsv with rules v2, the ammonia scenario, formaldehyde at 0.5 mol/L and a dilution of 5e-4 /s.
# Exported by Genesis tools/network_export.c. Species are named by their SMILES; the concentration of
# each dynamic species is the core's persisted state (mol/L).
temperature 298.14999999999998
species C=O CH2O 0 dynamic 3.3909999999999998e-06
species O H2O 0 reservoir 1
